    narr:narration """This hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) of capturing decision artifacts at the point of consensus. Recent activity from August 2026 demonstrates the practical realization of this strategy. The team [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785664832649_1), which serves as the functional embodiment of the capture thesis. This milestone is framed alongside [record-high velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785664832649_2), suggesting that the implementation of these capture mechanisms correlates with increased team output. The [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785664832649_3) is identified as the technical catalyst that enabled this progress, grounding the abstract goal of decision capture in specific architectural dependencies.""" ;
